<title>ITALY: Italy has global trade surplus in April.</title>
<headline>Italy has global trade surplus in April.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy had a 2.74 lire global trade surplus in April, the Italian Exchange Office said in a statement.</p>
<p> ITALIAN TRADE BALANCE	Apr 97	  Mar 97     Apr 96</p>
<p> Amount (lire)	     +2.736 trln   +1.944 trln   +1.823 trln</p>
<p> Cumulative yr to date   +9.164 trln   +6.408 trln   +6.215 trln</p>
<p>Note: The calculation is based on flows through the financial sector on transactions in excess of 20 million lire.</p>
</text>
